---
// The core facility example's flow: the requesting project's lane and the core's, with the
// request's states and the lab roles that set them, the core's private work item, and its
// deliverables. Drawn in the page's colours, in both themes.
---

<figure class="flow">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 360 566" role="img" aria-labelledby="request-flow-title request-flow-desc">
    <title id="request-flow-title">This lab's request flow</title>
    <desc id="request-flow-desc">
      The requesting project writes a request and sends its tubes. At the core the request is
      Submitted, then Accepted or Declined by a coordinator, and In progress with an analyst. The
      core tracks its own work in a work item only its project sees: Queued, Scheduled, Running,
      Done. A reviewer delivers a deliverable for each tube, which the requesting project then sees.
      A reviewer or QA sets the request to Delivered once once every tube has a result. The
      requesting project can withdraw the request while it's open.
    </desc>
    <text class="lane" x="66" y="20">
      Requesting project
    </text>
    <text class="lane" x="256" y="20">
      Sequencing core
    </text>
    <line class="divider" x1="140" y1="32" x2="140" y2="520"></line>
    <rect class="box" x="6" y="44" width="124" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="68" y="64">
      Writes a request
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="68" y="81">
      and sends its tubes
    </text>
    <rect class="box" x="6" y="124" width="124" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="68" y="144">
      Can withdraw it
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="68" y="161">
      while it's open
    </text>
    <rect class="box" x="6" y="364" width="124" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="68" y="384">
      Sees each result
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="68" y="401">
      as it's delivered
    </text>
    <rect class="state" x="158" y="44" width="196" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="256" y="64">
      Submitted
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="256" y="81">
      sent, waiting for the core
    </text>
    <rect class="state" x="158" y="124" width="196" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="256" y="144">
      Accepted, or Declined
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="256" y="161">
      set by a Coordinator
    </text>
    <rect class="state" x="158" y="204" width="196" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="256" y="224">
      In progress
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="256" y="241">
      set by the Analyst
    </text>
    <rect class="private" x="158" y="284" width="196" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="256" y="304">
      A work item
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="256" y="321">
      Queued, Scheduled, Running, Done
    </text>
    <rect class="box" x="158" y="364" width="196" height="48" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="256" y="384">
      A deliverable for each tube
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="256" y="401">
      delivered by a Reviewer
    </text>
    <rect class="state" x="158" y="444" width="196" height="62" rx="6"></rect>
    <text class="label" x="256" y="464">
      Delivered
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="256" y="481">
      set by a Reviewer or QA
    </text>
    <text class="note" x="256" y="497">
      once every tube has a result
    </text>

    <path class="arrow" d="M130 68 H152"></path>
    <path class="head" d="M158 68 l-7 -4 v8 z"></path>
    <path class="arrow" d="M256 92 V118"></path>
    <path class="head" d="M256 124 l-4 -7 h8 z"></path>
    <path class="arrow" d="M256 172 V198"></path>
    <path class="head" d="M256 204 l-4 -7 h8 z"></path>
    <path class="arrow" d="M256 252 V278"></path>
    <path class="head" d="M256 284 l-4 -7 h8 z"></path>
    <path class="arrow" d="M256 332 V358"></path>
    <path class="head" d="M256 364 l-4 -7 h8 z"></path>
    <path class="arrow" d="M256 412 V438"></path>
    <path class="head" d="M256 444 l-4 -7 h8 z"></path>
    <path class="arrow" d="M158 388 H136"></path>
    <path class="head" d="M130 388 l7 -4 v8 z"></path>

    <rect class="key-state" x="6" y="528" width="14" height="12" rx="3"></rect>
    <text class="key" x="26" y="538">
      A state of the request, and the lab role that sets it
    </text>
    <rect class="key-private" x="6" y="548" width="14" height="12" rx="3"></rect>
    <text class="key" x="26" y="558">
      Seen only in the core's project
    </text>
  </svg>
</figure>

<style>
  .flow {
    margin: 24px 0;
    max-width: 560px;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    font-family: inherit;
  }
  text {
    text-anchor: middle;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .lane {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .note,
  .key {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    fill: var(--muted);
  }
  .key {
    text-anchor: start;
  }
  .divider {
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }
  .box {
    fill: var(--surface);
    stroke: var(--border-strong);
  }
  .state,
  .key-state {
    fill: var(--accent-soft);
    stroke: var(--accent);
  }
  .private,
  .key-private {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--border-strong);
    stroke-dasharray: 5 4;
  }
  .arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--muted);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .head {
    fill: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
